    "detailed_description": "Embark on the magical adventure of &quot;Magus Pocus&quot; and discover a realm full of challenges. Your fearless wizard, while collecting shining coins, not only accumulates points but also strengthens their life, becoming more resilient against emerging dangers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nConfront mystical enemies, avoid traps, and explore secret areas while seeking these precious coins. Each of them is a vital source, providing not only scores but also renewed vitality.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn &quot;Magus Pocus,&quot; each coin is more than a treasure; it is the key to magical mastery and survival in this enchanted kingdom. Master the spells, accumulate coins, and become the ultimate wizard. Are you ready for the mystical journey?",
